{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43919","headline":"新妆诗 · 杨容华","name":"新妆诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"啼鸟惊眠罢，房栊乘晓开。\n凤钗金作缕，鸾镜玉爲台。\n妆似临池出，人疑向月来。\n自怜终不见，欲去复裴回。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨容华","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43919.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43919","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}